    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight by SMASHING the enemies with your Swarm. Your HP is Your Attack.<br>Harvest Cybermana from The Entities to grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/3f193efbfe2e5c0d5acf213bcca2a68d.poster.avif?t=1739704921\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/3f193efbfe2e5c0d5acf213bcca2a68d.webm?t=1739704921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/3f193efbfe2e5c0d5acf213bcca2a68d.mp4?t=1739704921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infest your enemies to HEAL after incubation finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b1adb0a19815d4e70c64877073cfeeff.poster.avif?t=1739704921\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b1adb0a19815d4e70c64877073cfeeff.webm?t=1739704921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b1adb0a19815d4e70c64877073cfeeff.mp4?t=1739704921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Skill Tree and become The Monolith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/910e9bd511dc0cd2fa581f1917e23f03.poster.avif?t=1739704921\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a